<title>BELGIUM: EU says Spanish maize tender to open May 22.</title>
<headline>EU says Spanish maize tender to open May 22.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tender for preferential imports of 500,000 tonnes of maize into Spain from non-EU countries will open on May 22 and close on June 26, the European Commission said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In EU Official Journal L 122/7, it said that import licences will remain valid for 50 days from date of issue.</p>
<p>The quota, approved under GATT world trade rules, compensates exporters for trade losses after Spain joined the EU in 1986.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
